                                 Subroutine SYM1S
                                 ----------------

 KB     0
 NHKTA/B     1    1
 IA offsets for shell    2
     2
 IB offsets for shell    1
     1


  ***************************************
  ********** ISHELA/B =  2,  1 **********
  ***************************************

 NHKT            1         1
 KHKT            1         1
